units.spec:
The item catalog. Export:
- `RARITIES` = exactly ["common","uncommon","rare","legendary","cursed"] in that order.
- `ITEMS`: an array of AT LEAST 55 item objects, each `{ id, name, rarity, tags, requires, stacks, effects, desc }` where id is a unique snake_case slug, rarity is one of RARITIES, tags is a non-empty array drawn only from ["offense","defense","mobility","economy"], requires is null or the id of another item in the catalog (never itself), stacks is a boolean, effects is a non-empty object whose every value is EITHER `true` (a flag) OR an object with only `add` and/or `mul` numeric keys, e.g. `{ damage: { mul: 1.15 } }` or `{ maxHp: { add: 25 } }` or `{ secondWind: true }`.
- `ITEM_BY_ID`: an object mapping every id to its item (same object reference).
- `queryItems({ rarity, tag, requiresMet, held = [] } = {})`: filter ITEMS. `rarity` keeps only that rarity; `tag` keeps items whose tags include it; `requiresMet: true` drops any item whose `requires` is not in `held`. No arguments returns all items.

All five rarities must appear; at least 5 legendary and at least 5 cursed items; legendaries have stacks:false. Include these exact items with these exact ids, values and flags:
hot_rounds "Hot Rounds" common stacks:true effects {damage:{mul:1.15}} tags [offense]
glass_cannon "Glass Cannon" rare effects {damage:{mul:1.6}, maxHp:{mul:0.6}}
overclock "Overclock" common stacks:true {fireRate:{mul:1.25}}
executioner "Executioner" rare {executeBelow:{add:0.2}}
shrapnel "Shrapnel" uncommon {onKillExplode:{add:0.3}}
chain_reaction "Chain Reaction" rare requires "shrapnel" {explosionsChain:true}
crit_lens "Crit Lens" common stacks:true {critChance:{add:0.2}}
bottomless "Bottomless" common stacks:true {freeShotChance:{add:0.25}}
ignition "Ignition" uncommon stacks:true {onHitBurn:{add:4}}
wildfire "Wildfire" rare requires "ignition" {burnSpreads:true}
plating "Plating" common stacks:true {maxHp:{add:25}} tags [defense]
kill_drip "Kill Drip" common stacks:true {healOnKill:{add:5}}
long_legs "Long Legs" common stacks:true {moveSpeed:{mul:1.15}} tags [mobility]
magpie "Magpie" rare {draftSize:{add:1}} tags [economy]
lucky_coin "Lucky Coin" common stacks:true {luck:{add:0.1}} tags [economy]
the_loop "The Loop" legendary {floorRetry:true}
berserker_pact "Berserker Pact" cursed {damage:{mul:2}, noHeal:true}

For the rest, follow this design list — offense: bloodhound, headhunter, first_blood, last_round, twin_link, static_charge, frostbite, punch_through (stacks), ricochet_plate, big_iron. Defense: second_wind, vampiric (stacks), regen_coil, bulwark, bullet_time, deflector (stacks), overshield, thorns. Mobility: double_jump, air_brakes, blink_dash, dash_reset, momentum, slide, feather. Economy: reroll_token, greed, cartographer, skeleton_key, duplicator (legendary). Legendary: infinite_mag, gunfu, singularity, ghost. Cursed: glass_legs, hoarders_curse, blindfire, borrowed_time. Invent sensible effects for each in the {add}/{mul}/true shape. Reach at least 55 total; add more of your own invention if needed, keeping ids unique.
